@startmindmap utility_tree
' RapidMed: utility tree of quality attribute scenarios
' CSE4203 Principles of Software Architecture, Milestone 1, Section 7.
' Render:  java -jar plantuml.jar -tpng utility_tree.puml
' Each leaf is rated (business value, architectural impact): H high, M medium, L low.
' Orange leaves are the architecturally significant requirements (ASR-1 to ASR-5).

skinparam dpi 300
<style>
mindmapDiagram {
  title { FontName "Liberation Sans"; FontSize 20; FontStyle bold; Margin 4 }
  node {
    FontName "Liberation Sans"
    FontSize 15
    Padding 7
    Margin 7
    RoundCorner 10
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    LineColor #8C8C8C
    LineThickness 1.2
    MaximumWidth 330
  }
  :depth(0) { BackgroundColor #1F4E79; FontColor #FFFFFF; FontStyle bold; FontSize 17 }
  :depth(1) { BackgroundColor #E7EEF6; LineColor #1F4E79; FontStyle bold }
  :depth(2) { BackgroundColor #F4F4F1 }
  .asr { BackgroundColor #FCE4D6; LineColor #C55A11; LineThickness 1.8 }
  arrow { LineColor #8C8C8C; LineThickness 1.2 }
  legend { FontName "Liberation Sans"; FontSize 14; BackgroundColor #FFFFFF; LineColor #8C8C8C }
}
</style>

title Utility tree for RapidMed

* Utility
** Consistency (safety)
*** Bed reservation
**** (H, H) QAS-4: two crews request the last bed; exactly one gets it, 0 double reservations in 1,000 runs <<asr>>
** Availability
*** Offline data entry
**** (H, H) QAS-1: outages of up to 30 minutes; 0 entries lost, all on the server within 30 s of reconnecting <<asr>>
*** External service failure
**** (H, H) QAS-2: Routes API down; an estimated destination within 3 s for every request <<asr>>
** Security
*** Emergency access
**** (H, H) QAS-5: break-glass summary within 3 s; every access audited, no record editable <<asr>>
** Performance
*** Peak load
**** (H, H) QAS-3: 200 destination requests in 60 s; 95% answered within 3 s <<asr>>
** Interoperability
*** Sanad integration
**** (M, H) QAS-6: never above 60 requests a minute; 100% valid FHIR R4 with user and reason <<asr>>
** Usability
*** Vital-signs entry
**** (H, L) QAS-7: 8 of 10 new users record a full set within 60 s; SUS score of 68 or more
** Modifiability
*** Routing provider
**** (M, M) QAS-8: new provider within 2 person-days, changing the adapter only

legend bottom left
<b>Legend</b>
Dark blue: the root, overall utility
Light blue: quality attribute
Grey: refinement of the attribute
White: scenario, rated (business value, architectural impact) as H high, M medium or L low
Orange: scenario behind an architecturally significant requirement
Lines run from a node to the nodes that refine it
endlegend
@endmindmap
